ate":-1,"lastViewed":1792209600000},{"id":"21f0307fbb53431c9c5292b5942147e3","owner":"becca.halter_ADKLT","created":1674161665000,"modified":1780497384000,"guid":null,"name":"Essex_County_Ag_Tiers_-_2022","title":"Ag Tiers - Essex, Franklin and Clinton County","type":"Feature Service","typeKeywords":["ArcGIS API for JavaScript","ArcGIS Server","Data","Feature Access","Feature Service","Service","Singlelayer","Hosted Service","View Service"],"description":"The tiers were determined as follows:<div><br /><\/div><div><div>Tier 1: Largest Farms<\/div><div>  1.<span>\t<\/span>Acreage: greater than or equal to 100 acres AND<\/div><div>        a.<span>\t<\/span>Ag soils: greater than or equal to 50% of parcel OR<\/div><div>       b.<span>\t<\/span>Ag land use:<span>\t<\/span>greater than or equal to 50% of parcel<\/div><div>Tier 2: Medium Farms<\/div><div>  1.<span>\t<\/span>Acreage:  greater than or equal to 50 acres and less than 100 <\/div><div>         AND<\/div><div>         a.<span>\t<\/span>Ag soils: greater than or equal to 75% of parcel OR<\/div><div>         b.    Ag land use:<span>\t<\/span>greater than or equal to 75% of parcel<\/div><div>Tier 3: Vegetable/Small Scale Farms<\/div><div>  1.<span>\t<\/span>Parcel Size: greater than or equal to 7 acres and less than 50 <\/div><div>        acres AND<\/div><div>  2.<span>\t<\/span>Prime Soil Acreage: greater than or equal to 2 acre AND<\/div><div>  3.<span>\t<\/span>% Ag Land Use: greater than or equal to 15%<\/div><\/div><div><br /><\/div>","tags":["ALT","parcels","ownership","private","priority mapping.","essex county","ag tiers"],"snippet":"Privately owned real property parcels symbolized by their ag tier ranking as determined by the 2022 Essex County Farmland Protection Plan. Essex County analysis work was done by ALT with funding from NYS Ag and Markets Ag Access Outreach grant. Franklin and Clinton County done by Skidmore students in spring 2026.","thumbnail":"thumbnail/thumbnail1674227874335.png","documentation":null,"extent":[[-75.48695119098352,43.033116552012906],[-73.19695522621244,45.02243763979424]],"categories":[],"spatialReference":"26918","accessInformation":"","classification":null,"licenseInfo":"","culture":"en-us","properties":null,"advancedSettings":null,"url":"https://services3.arcgis.com/vD01YCkwuh1qrRGY/arcgis/rest/services/Essex_County_Ag_Tiers_-_2022/FeatureServer","proxyFilter":null,"access":"public","size":-1,"subInfo":0,"appCategories":[],"industries":[],"languages":[],"largeThumbnail":null,"banner":null,"screenshots":[],"listed":false,"numComments":0,"numRatings":0,"avgRating":0,"numViews":1648,"scoreCompleteness":83,"groupDesignations":null,"apiToken1ExpirationDate":-1,"apiToken2ExpirationDate":-1,"lastViewed":1792206000000},{"id":"fb7383782def4b329d5e238b06078ab1","owner":"HAbramo@idem.IN.gov_IndianaDEM","created":1635532841000,"modified":1635532848000,"guid":null,"name":null,"title":"2626_baltimore_ave","type":"Feature Service","typeKeywords":["ArcGIS Server","Data","Feature Access","Feature Service","Metadata","Service","Singlelayer","Hosted Service"],"description":"<DIV STYLE=\"text-align:Left;\"><DIV><DIV><P><SPAN>CountyParcels_DLGF_RESTRICTED is an enhanced version of County Parcel data collected from each of the 92 counties in Indiana as part of the Indiana Data Sharing Initiative (IDSI). These data include the parcel features and attributes from assessment data provided to the Department of Local Government and Finance. Please note, there may be records with duplicate parcel IDs. That will result in the DLGF information being duplicated for each record. The owner, class code, etc. will still be correct, but the value and deeded acreage fields will be for the sum of the matched numbers, not the individual polygons. IMPORTANT: All records in this dataset are completely replaced with each update. Therefore, using the \"Create Layer from Selected Features\" in ArcMap will not work correctly after the proceeding update, nor will definition queries based on OBJECTID.<\/SPAN><\/P><P><SPAN>Latest update: 11/7/2019 with 2019 polygons (GIO.COUNTY_Parcel) and 2018 pay 2019 DLGF information. <\/SPAN><\/P><\/DIV><\/DIV><\/DIV>","tags":["Indiana","Adams County","Allen County","Bartholomew County","Benton County","Blackford County","Brown County","Cass County","Clark County","Clay County","Clinton County","Daviess County","Dearborn County","Decatur County","Dekalb County","Delaware County","Dubois County","Elkhart County","Fayette County","Floyd County","Franklin County","Fulton County","Gibson County","Grant County","Greene County","Hamilton County","Hancock County","Harrison County","Hendricks County","Henry County","Howard County","Huntington County","Jackson County","Jasper County","Jay County","Jefferson County","Jennings County","Johnson County","Knox County","Kosciusko County","Lagrange County","Lake County","LaPorte County","Lawrence County","Madison County","Marion County","Martin County","Miami County","Monroe County","Montgomery County","Morgan County","Noble County","Ohio County","Orange County","Owen County","Parke County","Perry County","Pike County","Porter County","Posey County","Pulaski County","Putnam County","Randolph County","Ripley County","Rush County","Scott County","Shelby County","Spencer County","St. Joseph County","Starke County","Steuben County","Sullivan County","Tippecanoe County","Tipton County","Vanderburgh County","Vermillion County","Vigo County","Wabash County","Warrick County","Washington County","Wayne County","Wells County","White County","Whitley County"],"snippet":"CountyParcels_DLGF_RESTRICTED was created to provide state agency personnel, for internal use only, with detailed parcel information. IMPORTANT: All records in this dataset are completely replaced with each update. Therefore, using the \"Create Layer from Selected Features\" in ArcMap will not work correctly after the proceeding update, nor will definition queries based on OBJECTID.\n\nLatest update: 11/7/2019 with 2019 polygons (GIO.COUNTY_Parcel) and 2018 pay 2019 DLGF information. ","thumbnail":"thumbnail/ago_downloaded.png","documentation":null,"extent":[[-86.12688123909274,39.8049695977967],[-86.12641263709914,39.805172505224824]],"categories":[],"spatialReference":"102100","accessInformation":"This data set was created as part of the Indiana Data Sharing Initiative (IDSI) between Indiana Geographic Information Council (IGIC), Indiana Geographic Information Office (IGIO), Indiana Geological and Water Survey (IGWS) and participating Indiana counties. Parcel details provided by the Indiana Department of Local Government and Finance (DLGF).","classification":null,"licenseInfo":"<DIV STYLE=\"text-align:Left;\"><DIV><DIV><P><SPAN>This dataset is restricted for internal use only by staff of Indiana state agencies.This dataset is provided by Indiana Department of Natural Resources, and contains data believed to be accurate; however, a degree of error is inherent in all data. These data are distributed \"AS-IS\" without warranties of any kind, either expressed or implied, including but not limited to warranties of suitability of a particular purpose or use. This preliminary data are not to be used for any official or business purpose. No attempt has been made in either the designed format or production of these data to define the limits or jurisdiction of any federal, state, or local government. These data are intended for use only at the published scale or smaller and are for reference purposes only. They are not to be construed as a legal document or survey instrument. A detailed on-the-ground survey and historical analysis of a single site may differ from these data. The product is provided \"AS IS\", without any other warranties or conditions, expressed or implied, including, but not limited to, warranties for product quality, or suitability to a particular purpose or use. The risk or liability resulting from the use of this product is assumed by the user. Indiana Geographic